 "description": "<p>A Christmas dress that leans plush rather than printed: headband, neck ring, dress, and thong in red chiffon with bow detailing, sized one-size for 40-60 kg. The headband and neck ring carry the holiday cues so the dress itself stays simple.</p>\n<p>The bows are placed where they earn their keep - at the neck and wherever the pictures show them - and the chiffon falls straight without petticoat assistance. Red all the way through, no white trim.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon</li>\n<li>Includes: headband, neck ring, dress, thong</li>\n<li>Style: Christmas, bow detailing</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Four pieces in one purchase, sized 40-60 kg. December calendar material without a single snowflake.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red plush-bow Christmas dress set with headband, neck ring and thong, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
